before:
Complete local C example; the app itself does not execute it:
```c
#include <stdio.h>
#ifndef VERBOSE
#define VERBOSE 0
#endif
#if VERBOSE
#define MESSAGE "details"
#else
#define MESSAGE "brief"
#endif

int main(void) {
    puts(MESSAGE);
    return 0;
}
```

